# Assistant

Assistant is a tool that can help you to get the code for your Java code. It can be used for any type of code.

## Installation

Use the package manager [maven](https://maven.apache.org/) to install Assistant.

```bash
mvn clean install
```

## Usage

```bash
java -jar assistant.jar
```

## Contributing
Pull requests are welcome. For major changes, please open an issue first to discuss what you would like to change.

Please make sure to update tests as appropriate.

