## Create a class

To create a class, use the keyword `class` followed by the name of the class.

```java
class MyClass {
}
```

The code above creates a class called `MyClass`. The class has no fields or methods.

When you create a class, you can use the `new` keyword to create an instance of the class.

```java
MyClass myClass = new MyClass();
